  "This one-shot matches nothing now. Remove on.disarmed in the triggers file to arm it again; keeping the row preserves its history number.": "此一次性规则当前不会匹配任何事件。移除 triggers 文件中的 on.disarmed 可重新启用；保留该行可保留其历史编号。",
