  "GitHub matches the issue's whole label set. Re-labelling or reopening can start another paid run, including each configured replica.": "GitHub 会匹配问题的全部标签。重新标记或重新打开问题可能再次启动付费运行，包括每个已配置副本。",
  "On GitLab, changing labels counts as an update. A merge does not fire a close rule.": "在 GitLab 中，更改标签会视为更新。合并不会触发关闭规则。",
  "Azure pull request actions use created or updated. Pull request labels and close-only actions are not available.": "Azure 拉取请求动作使用 created 或 updated。拉取请求标签和仅关闭动作不可用。",
