  "Describe a hypothetical forge event": "描述一个假设的代码托管事件", "Issue or pull request number": "问题或拉取请求编号", "Current labels, one per line": "当前标签，每行一个", "Previous labels, one per line": "之前的标签，每行一个",
  "Authority is a hypothetical assumption. Comment text stays in this request; it is never placed in the address bar or audit log.": "权限为假设值。评论内容仅随本次请求发送，不会放入地址栏或审计日志。",
  "Enable JavaScript to check an event. Rules, filters and navigation remain available; no event text can be submitted into the address bar.": "启用 JavaScript 以检查事件。规则、筛选和导航仍可使用；事件文本不会提交到地址栏。",
  "Event check result": "事件检查结果", "Describe an event to see hypothetical matching. Nothing will be sent to a forge, queued or spent.": "描述事件以查看假设匹配结果。不会向代码托管服务发送请求、加入队列或产生费用。",
  "Which rule would run?": "哪些规则会运行？", "Describe an event and see which rule matches, and why the others do not. Nothing is sent to a forge or spent.": "描述一个事件，查看匹配的规则以及其他规则未匹配的原因。不会向代码托管服务发送请求或产生费用。",
