  "The event could not be checked": "无法检查此事件", "The event description was refused.": "事件描述已被拒绝。", "No delivery was sent or queued; nothing was spent.": "未发送投递或加入队列，也未产生费用。",
  "No rule would match this description": "没有规则匹配此描述",
  Route: "路由", "hypothetical match": "假设匹配", "This is not a promise that a real delivery will start a paid job.": "这不代表真实投递一定会启动付费作业。", "Hypothetical matching only. Nothing was authenticated, sent, queued or spent.": "仅为假设匹配。未验证、发送或排队任何请求，也未产生费用。", "The rules": "规则", "Checks a real delivery must still pass": "真实投递仍须通过的检查", "Delivery authentication and current admission gates were not checked here.": "此处未检查投递身份验证和当前准入条件。",
  "Host beats look stale (clock skew?), but the queue still sees its workers connected.": "主机心跳似乎已过期（可能是时钟偏差），但队列仍能看到 worker 已连接。",
  "The host registry could not be read; this shows the fleet as it was last seen.": "无法读取主机注册表；此处显示主机群上次读取时的状态。",
  "Days, weeks (Monday to Sunday) and months here are UTC, as the budget counts them.": "此处的日、周（周一至周日）和月均使用 UTC，与预算的统计方式一致。",
  "A question is a parked run nobody has answered; to fix is a failed job the queue still keeps, or a registered host whose doctor fails.": "问题是尚无人回答的暂停运行；待修复项是队列仍保留的失败作业，或 doctor 检查失败的已注册主机。",
  "Last 24 hours: no failed or refused run among the runs read, but the run history read does not reach back a day.": "过去 24 小时：已读取的记录中没有失败或拒绝的运行，但运行历史记录未覆盖完整一天。",
  "A job with no project tag is in no project, or no run record read here names one.": "没有项目标签的作业可能不属于任何项目，或当前读取的运行记录没有注明项目。",
  "A job with no project tag is in no project, or its project is not known until it starts.": "没有项目标签的作业可能不属于任何项目，或要等它启动后才能确定所属项目。",
  "nothing needs you": "没有需要你处理的事项", "No questions, failures or refusals in the last 24 hours.": "过去 24 小时内没有问题、失败或拒绝。",
  "nothing is waiting": "没有作业在等待", "No job is waiting to start.": "没有作业等待启动。", "nothing is running": "没有作业在运行", "No job is running on any host.": "没有作业在任何主机上运行。",
   "No run has settled any spend today.": "今天还没有运行记录产生最终费用。", "no host is registered yet": "尚未注册主机", "No host is registered. A worker registers when it starts.": "尚未注册主机。worker 启动时会自动注册。",
  "No job waits for a slot, another run, or a time or check.": "没有作业在等待空位、其他运行、时间或检查。", "From the soft hold new starts are refused; nothing is spent.": "软性暂停期间会拒绝新的启动，不会产生费用。", "The soft hold refuses rather than holds.": "软性暂停会直接拒绝，而不是让作业继续等待。",
  "The slot frees when that job's container is gone; nothing in the console reaches another host's runtime.": "该作业的容器退出后，空位才会释放；控制台不会操作其他主机上的运行环境。",
  "Its registry row has no expiry, so it will not leave the registry by itself, and the host may be gone. Doctor or a restart of its worker clears it.": "此注册记录没有过期时间，因此不会自动移除，主机也可能已离线。运行 doctor 或重启对应 worker 可清除记录。",
  "No doctor result yet": "尚无 doctor 结果", "Dots: each UTC hour's settled spend, from the run records. The number is the day window's spent and held.": "圆点表示运行记录中每个 UTC 小时的最终费用。数字为当日统计窗口的已支出和预留金额。", "Dots: each UTC hour's settled spend, from the run records. The number is their sum.": "圆点表示运行记录中每个 UTC 小时的最终费用。数字为这些小时费用的总和。",
  "Not every waiting job was read, so jobs in line may be missing here.": "并非所有等待中的作业都已读取，因此此处可能缺少排队作业。", "The settings overlay sets no cap.": "设置覆盖项未设置预算上限。",
  "The parked runs could not be read, so the questions are not counted.": "无法读取暂停的运行记录，因此未统计待回答问题。", "The failed jobs could not be read, so they are not counted.": "无法读取失败作业，因此未统计失败数量。", "The doctor results could not be read, so failing doctors are not counted.": "无法读取 doctor 结果，因此未统计检查失败的主机。",
  "The host registry could not be read, so failing doctors are not counted.": "无法读取主机注册表，因此未统计检查失败的主机。", "The host registry could not be read and the queue sees no worker connected, so failing doctors are not counted and whether a worker is online is not known.": "无法读取主机注册表，且队列未发现已连接的 worker，因此未统计检查失败的主机，也无法确认是否有 worker 在线。",
  "The run history could not be read, so the day's failures are not counted.": "无法读取运行历史记录，因此未统计当日失败数量。", "The waiting jobs could not be read.": "无法读取等待中的作业。", "The settings overlay could not be read, so its caps are not drawn.": "无法读取设置覆盖项，因此未显示预算上限。", "The dollar counters could not be read.": "无法读取金额计数器。", "The job or token counters could not be read, so their windows are not drawn.": "无法读取作业或令牌计数器，因此未显示其统计窗口。", "The run records could not be read, so the spend per hour is not drawn.": "无法读取运行记录，因此未显示每小时费用。", "Not every run record of today was read, so these hours may be missing spend.": "今天并非所有运行记录都已读取，因此这些小时可能缺少费用。", "The run history could not be read, so only what runs and waits is drawn.": "无法读取运行历史记录，因此仅显示正在运行和等待中的作业。", "Some run records could not be read, so runs in this window may be missing.": "部分运行记录不可读，因此此时间范围内可能缺少运行记录。",
  "The console could not read a matching result. Nothing was sent or queued.": "控制台无法读取匹配结果。未发送任何请求或加入队列。", Rule: "规则", "would match": "将匹配", "with flow": "使用流程", "with command": "使用命令",
  "Runs that ended in the last 24 hours, by outcome": "过去 24 小时结束的运行记录，按结果分类",
  "Runs that needed a person over": "过去需要人工处理的运行记录，时间范围为",
  "Counts are of the runs that ended in the last 24 hours.": "统计范围为过去 24 小时内结束的运行记录。",
  "The last 24 hours could not be counted: the run history could not be read.": "无法统计过去 24 小时的数据：运行历史记录不可读。",
  "Part of the run history could not be read, so each count is at least the number shown.": "部分运行历史记录不可读，因此每项计数至少为当前显示的数量。",
  "These are every project's counts: more projects ran than the window counts one by one.": "这是所有项目的合计：运行项目数超过了此时间范围逐项统计的上限。",
