  "In a terminal instead": "也可在终端中操作", "In the operator panel, press a to add a trigger through the dialogs.": "在操作员面板中按 a，通过对话框添加触发器。", "An operator can add a first trigger in the trigger editor.": "操作员可以在触发器编辑器中添加首个触发器。", "Start from scratch": "从头开始", "in the trigger editor. Preview the exact added lines before saving.": "在触发器编辑器中操作。保存前可预览将要添加的准确内容。", "The allowlist count is not published.": "允许列表数量尚未发布。", "hosts in this deployment's allowlist.": "台主机位于此部署的允许列表中。", "OpenShell uses gateway policy. Unsafe or shared proxy changes require the terminal.": "OpenShell 使用网关策略。修改不安全或共享的代理设置需要使用终端。", "Review the allowlist": "查看允许列表", "Review subscription authentication": "查看订阅身份验证", "Review Connections": "查看连接", "Receiver service": "接收器服务", ready: "就绪", starting: "正在启动", "This page updates from published facts. Starting a process alone never makes a step Ready.": "此页面根据已发布的信息更新。仅启动进程并不表示步骤已就绪。", "Use the terminal on the deployment host": "请在部署主机的终端中操作", "This console is read-only. Use the terminal alternatives to change the deployment.": "此控制台为只读模式。请使用终端方式更改部署。",
