  "declared in PI_SECRET_PROFILES": "已在 PI_SECRET_PROFILES 中声明", "declared in the settings overlay": "已在设置覆盖项中声明", "Ambiguous: declared in both PI_SECRET_PROFILES and the settings overlay, so the worker refuses every secrets job": "存在歧义：PI_SECRET_PROFILES 和设置覆盖项中均有声明，因此 worker 会拒绝所有密钥作业", "named by a trigger, declared in no source this view can see": "触发器中引用了此配置，但当前视图可见的来源中均未声明",
  "its resolver's real path on this host is inside PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS as written": "解析器在此主机上的实际路径位于 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS 声明的目录范围内", "its resolver's real path on this host is outside PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS, so the worker refuses every job naming it": "解析器在此主机上的实际路径超出 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS 范围，因此 worker 会拒绝所有引用它的作业", "its resolver cannot be resolved on this host, so only the worker can judge it against PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS (doctor --secrets)": "此主机无法解析该解析器，因此只能由 worker 根据 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS 判断范围（doctor --secrets）", "PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS is not visible here, so the roots are the worker's to judge (doctor --secrets)": "此处不可见 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS，因此由 worker 判断根目录范围（doctor --secrets）", "PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS is set and empty, so the worker refuses every overlay resolver": "PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS 已设置但为空，因此 worker 会拒绝所有覆盖项解析器",
  "served by: the host registry could not be read": "提供服务的主机注册表无法读取", "served by: the registry is not read here (the console's and the panel's profiles show the live hosts)": "此处未读取主机注册表（控制台和面板中的配置会显示在线主机）", "served by: no live host in the registry": "注册表中没有在线主机", "served by: no live host advertises it": "没有在线主机提供此配置", "no endpoints": "没有端点", "declared in PI_SECRET_BUNDLES; doctor --secrets checks it runs": "已在 PI_SECRET_BUNDLES 中声明；doctor --secrets 会检查其是否可运行", "declared in the settings overlay; its resolver cannot be resolved on this host, so only the worker can judge it against PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS; doctor --secrets checks it runs": "已在设置覆盖项中声明；此主机无法解析该解析器，因此只能由 worker 根据 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS 判断；doctor --secrets 会检查其是否可运行", "declared in the settings overlay; PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS is not visible to the panel; doctor --secrets checks it runs": "已在设置覆盖项中声明；面板无法读取 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS；doctor --secrets 会检查其是否可运行", "declared in the settings overlay, inside PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS as written; doctor --secrets checks it runs": "已在设置覆盖项中声明，且位于 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS 声明的范围内；doctor --secrets 会检查其是否可运行", "declared in the settings overlay but outside PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS, so the worker will not run it and this project's jobs are refused before they spend": "已在设置覆盖项中声明，但超出 PI_SECRET_RESOLVER_ROOTS 范围，因此 worker 不会运行它，并会在产生费用前拒绝此项目的作业", "declared in both PI_SECRET_BUNDLES and the overlay: the worker refuses every bundled job until one goes": "PI_SECRET_BUNDLES 和覆盖项中均有声明：移除其中一个声明前，worker 会拒绝所有捆绑作业", "PI_SECRET_BUNDLES does not parse: the worker does not start": "PI_SECRET_BUNDLES 无法解析：worker 不会启动", "not in the overlay, and PI_SECRET_BUNDLES is not visible to the panel; doctor --secrets on the worker's host says whether it is declared": "覆盖项中没有此声明，且面板无法读取 PI_SECRET_BUNDLES；请在 worker 主机运行 doctor --secrets 查看是否已声明", "not declared in the overlay or PI_SECRET_BUNDLES: this project's jobs are refused before they spend": "覆盖项和 PI_SECRET_BUNDLES 中均未声明：此项目的作业会在产生费用前被拒绝",
